```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unverified: LoadModelSpec
    Parsed --> TypeChecked: TypeCheckModelSpec
    StructureChecked --> Failed: RejectVacuousRules
    StructureChecked --> Verified: VerifyModelSpec
    TypeChecked --> StructureChecked: CheckStructureModelSpec
    Unverified --> Parsed: ParseModelSpec
    Failed --> [*]
    Verified --> [*]
```

**操作说明**

| 名称 | 说明 |
| --- | --- |
| `LoadModelSpec` | 载入待验证的需求文件，进入 Unverified |
| `ParseModelSpec` | 解析 .intent 源文件为 AST |
| `TypeCheckModelSpec` | 类型检查通过后才进入结构分析 |
| `CheckStructureModelSpec` | 结构门控：goal 认领、example、生命周期可达性（S0001–S0008） |
| `VerifyModelSpec` | Z3 验证 intent/theorem/example；@asis 规则默认跳过除非 --include-asis |
| `RejectVacuousRules` | V0020：规则子句不可满足时从 StructureChecked 转入 Failed |
